# DPD Control Tower — Architecture (living reference)

> **Maintain this file.** Append to **Change log** on every structural change. Tag entries `[admin+app]` when mobile handoff must update too.

**Product:** Enterprise rider workforce Control Tower (Musallam / DPD).  
**Admin:** Next.js 16 · https://dpdadmin-prod.vercel.app (`dpdadmin-prod`)  
**Driver app:** Separate repo (`MG-GO`) — paste [`docs/DRIVER_APP_HANDOFF.md`](../docs/DRIVER_APP_HANDOFF.md)  
**Backend:** Supabase `eoksxkdssptgyqyywdju` (`dpd-production`) + R2 `dpd-private-prod` + Firebase `musallam-delivery-prod`. Retired testing (`dpdadmin` / `ytfmsgckjatiserpgdbz` / `dpd-private` / `musallam-delivery-kw`) is not a target.

